{"data": [{"author_id": "1435654190605479942", "conversation_id": "2120186778384499073", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:55:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120319461001699424"], "id": "2120319461001699424", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@nvidia Adaptive reasoning that can explain why a vehicle yields or makes room is a meaningful step for trust in autonomy. Running it within onboard latency limits is the hard engineering part, so the technical blog is welcome.", "url": "https://x.com/iambasitshah/status/2120319461001699424"}, {"author_id": "2119528145866919937", "conversation_id": "2120186778384499073", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:53:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120318862105493724"], "id": "2120318862105493724", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@nvidia Can developers inspect the explanation alongside the planned path in simulation? Seeing why it chose a maneuver seems just as useful as seeing the maneuver itself", "url": "https://x.com/juanmagomezdev/status/2120318862105493724"}, {"author_id": "2118966356926464000", "conversation_id": "2120186778384499073", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:50:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120318200005206212"], "id": "2120318200005206212", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@nvidia a car that explains why it yielded is the only backseat driver i want 🐟💙", "url": "https://x.com/bigfishiex/status/2120318200005206212"}, {"author_id": "1533601362612989952", "conversation_id": "2120186778384499073", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:36:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120314793869316362"], "id": "2120314793869316362", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@nvidia https://t.co/zE00hiSSrN", "url": "https://x.com/ChenFrank123/status/2120314793869316362"}, {"author_id": "60711390", "conversation_id": "2120186778384499073", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:08:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120307623903760543"], "id": "2120307623903760543", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@LLuciano_BTC @nvidia With what? You gonna pay my bills guy? You’re the noise.", "url": "https://x.com/PikaDroo/status/2120307623903760543"}, {"author_id": "1807825213049991172", "conversation_id": "2120186778384499073", "created_at": "2026-11-10T23:43:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120301238906662967"], "id": "2120301238906662967", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 26, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@nvidia The ability to explain real-time driving decisions is just as important as making them. 🚘", "url": "https://x.com/Sonvia_ai/status/2120301238906662967"}, {"author_id": "2270798053", "conversation_id": "2120186778384499073", "created_at": "2026-11-10T23:28:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120297639707279452"], "id": "2120297639707279452", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@nvidia Real-time reasoning is a major step toward safer, more adaptable autonomous driving. Exciting to see open AI models pushing the field forward. 🚘 #Truval", "url": "https://x.com/TruvalNetwork/status/2120297639707279452"}, {"author_id": "2064562466437079040", "conversation_id": "2120186778384499073", "created_at": "2026-11-10T23:24:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120296628930089397"], "id": "2120296628930089397", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@nvidia Jensen's gotta go!!!", "url": "https://x.com/Motariislord/status/2120296628930089397"}, {"author_id": "343877206", "conversation_id": "2120186778384499073", "created_at": "2026-11-10T23:18:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120295016979673490"], "id": "2120295016979673490", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@nvidia Real-time reasoning in the car is where AI gets very practical. Exciting to see.", "url": "https://x.com/smobilefactory/status/2120295016979673490"}, {"author_id": "1410243693773090823", "conversation_id": "2120186778384499073", "created_at": "2026-11-10T22:59:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120290227755356513"], "id": "2120290227755356513", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 69, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@nvidia Start building with Alpamayo 2", "url": "https://x.com/BitcoinChina_/status/2120290227755356513"}, {"author_id": "1988350932053356548", "conversation_id": "2120186778384499073", "created_at": "2026-11-10T22:35:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120284325182873718"], "id": "2120284325182873718", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@Chenqiuyanliao @TraceKingo @nvidia I wonder why you're going to such extreme lengths to defend these industry leaders. What's in it for you?", "url": "https://x.com/rxyvoid/status/2120284325182873718"}, {"author_id": "2104597698578153472", "conversation_id": "2120186778384499073", "created_at": "2026-11-10T22:27:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120282109629944183"], "id": "2120282109629944183", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@nvidia Explaining its decisions is the part most self-driving demos skip. If a car can say why it yielded, passengers trust it faster — and regulators get something to audit. An open model should speed that up.", "url": "https://x.com/JulianLiu0414/status/2120282109629944183"}, {"author_id": "1881173355921108992", "conversation_id": "2120186778384499073", "created_at": "2026-11-10T22:25:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120281811242852523"], "id": "2120281811242852523", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 27, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@nvidia The explanation sold me on this one. I can accept a car that yields to a pedestrian, and I need to know why it chose that path when something goes wrong. An open model that shows its reasoning turns a black box into something I can audit.", "url": "https://x.com/harden_369741/status/2120281811242852523"}, {"author_id": "2011226893098655744", "conversation_id": "2120186778384499073", "created_at": "2026-11-10T22:14:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120278941856407964"], "id": "2120278941856407964", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@gfp100 @nvidia 3,000", "url": "https://x.com/digitaldink/status/2120278941856407964"}, {"author_id": "2107746338284937216", "conversation_id": "2120186778384499073", "created_at": "2026-11-10T22:10:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120277857079586823"], "id": "2120277857079586823", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@nvidia Alpamayo 2 Edge explaining its own driving decisions in real time — that's the difference between a black box and a product regulators will actually approve. Open model plus onboard compute is every carmaker's new default.", "url": "https://x.